submodule used for public headers and version metadata. See third_party/README.md
and third_party/onnxruntime/LICENSE for details.

MUSA toolkit libraries
The MUSA runtime, muBLAS, and muDNN libraries are external system dependencies
provided by the MUSA toolkit. They are not source code from this repository.
Users must install the compatible MUSA toolkit separately and ensure the
runtime libraries are visible to the dynamic linker.
